# Generated by main.py: two exported ONNX graphs (~650 MB each) and two engines (~480 MiB each).
# The ONNX files are caches -- delete them and the next run re-exports them. The engines are
# rebuilt on every run regardless (a plan is tied to the compute capability it was built on).
# Never commit any of them.
model-gpt2-step*.onnx
model-gpt2-step*.trt
